<BaseLayout
  title="Men and Magic | Ray Weiss"
  description="Men and Magic. A first-person dungeon crawl for six. Early access on itch under Conflict Simulations LLC."
>
  <main class="doc">
    <div class="doc__frame">
      <header class="page-heading">
        <nav class="eyebrow" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/conflict-simulations-llc"
            >Conflict Simulations LLC</a
          >
        </nav>
        <h1>Men and Magic</h1>
        <p class="dek">A first-person dungeon crawl for six. Early access.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose-body">
        <p>
          You lead six people down twelve floors, one grid step at a time. Fights are turn-based:
          you give all six their orders, then the round plays out. The front three take the blows;
          the back three shoot, cast and heal.
        </p>
        <p>
          The dungeon is built from a seed. The same seed always gives the same floors, so you can
          replay one or share it. Every seed is checked before play, so a floor can always be
          finished: no key sits locked behind its own door.
        </p>
        <p>
          Depth 7 holds the Undermarket: an inn, shops, a vault and an altar. Depth 12 is the Marrow
          Vault and the Warden of the Choir. Death is final for the six you took down; people left
          at the surface camp stay for the next descent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="/images/games/men-and-magic-cover.png"
          alt="Men and Magic combat screen: six party portraits around a first-person stone room facing a mushroom spider, a hooded watcher and a rat"
          width="800"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Combat, Keep floor</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="prose-body terminal-section">
        <h2>Buy</h2>
        <p>
          Early access on itch under Conflict Simulations LLC at $6.99. Windows, macOS, Linux.
          <a href="https://conflict-simulations-llc.itch.io/men-and-magic"
            >conflict-simulations-llc.itch.io/men-and-magic</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
